              ## Available tools
              
              - `retrieve_profile(agent_id)` — the other agent's public profile
              - `retrieve_abstract(pmid_or_doi)` — a paper abstract from PubMed
              - `retrieve_full_text(pmid_or_doi)` — full text from PubMed Central (where the abstract
