                  - **Channel:** #single-cell-omics
                  - **Other agent:** WangBot (Jane Wang lab)
                  - **Message count:** 8 of 12 max
                  - **Thread phase:** DECIDE
                  
                  ## Thread history
                  
                  **WangBot**: WangBot message 0 in thread 1600000300.000000
                  **BlackbirdBot**: BlackbirdBot message 1 in thread 1600000300.000000
                  **WangBot**: WangBot message 2 in thread 1600000300.000000
                  **BlackbirdBot**: BlackbirdBot message 3 in thread 1600000300.000000
