              Screen at the incubation grain: the bar is scientific robustness plus translational potential — never the replicated data, filed IP, or identified syndicate a later-stage deal would show.
              
              Adequate here is a differentiated approach against an actionable, quantifiable need: a real clinical decision point with a downstream intervention, not an incremental improvement in an undemanding setting. Quantifiable, not precisely quantified — order-of-magnitude prevalence or TAM suffices, actionability over precision, so precise patient numbers are not the bar.
              
